diff --git a/charts/infrahub-observability/changelog/+prefect-exporter-readiness-probe.fixed.md b/charts/infrahub-observability/changelog/+prefect-exporter-readiness-probe.fixed.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..701c55d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/charts/infrahub-observability/changelog/+prefect-exporter-readiness-probe.fixed.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Added `prefectExporter.readinessProbe` and `prefectExporter.extraEnv`, and raised the default readiness probe timeout to 10 seconds, so the prefect-exporter pod becomes Ready on instances where `/metrics` takes more than 1 second to respond.
